# Changelog

Tutti i cambi rilevanti documentati. Formato [Keep a Changelog](https://keepachangelog.com/en/1.1.0/), versioning [SemVer](https://semver.org/).

## [Unreleased]

### Added

- Documentazione definitiva organizzata secondo framework Diátaxis (`docs/index.md`, `docs/tutorials/`, `docs/explanation/`, `docs/reference/`).
- `SECURITY.md` con threat model + disclosure policy.
- `CONTRIBUTING.md` con workflow e convenzioni.
- `CHANGELOG.md` Keep-a-Changelog format.
- Runbooks: `deploy-dgx.md`, `rotate-keys.md`, `restore-audit.md`.
- ADR template `docs/adr/TEMPLATE.md`.

## [0.1.0] — 2026-05-03 — MVP scaffold

### Added — Backend Engine

- FastAPI + Uvicorn su Unix socket (default) o TCP loopback opt-in.
- Auth argon2id login → JWT EdDSA (Ed25519) [`core/jwt.py`](docheck-engine/src/docheck/core/jwt.py).
- RBAC `(resource, action)` via `require()` dependency.
- Audit log Ed25519 hash-chained, immutable triggers, **per-tenant chain**.
- LangGraph multi-agent: Classifier · Structurer · Legal · Technical · PII · Synthesizer (parallel fan-out).
- Glass-box: `evidence.bbox` + `policy_ref.excerpt` validation Pydantic.
- Vector store abstraction: ChromaDB (MVP) ↔ Qdrant (multi-tenant) con tenant scoping.
- Document parsers: PDF (pdfplumber + PaddleOCR fallback), DOCX, XLSX, MD/TXT.
- Report signing Ed25519 + verify CLI-friendly.
- WebSocket streaming pipeline events.
- OpenTelemetry locale (file exporter, no cloud).
- OIDC stub (issuer config-flag).
- Postgres RLS migration + session GUC binding.
- Multi-tenant: `TenantMixin` colonna `tenant_id`, ContextVar propagation, middleware.
- Built-in deterministic policy (`DocCheck_Builtin`) sempre applicata, surface in `policies_applied`.
- Document classifier (ADR-0011) → `doc_type` + applicability filter per agente.

### Added — Frontend UI

- Layout 60/40 split-pane resizable.
- Document Viewer con highlight bbox + scroll-to-finding.
- FindingsPanel virtualizzata (`react-virtuoso`).
- Reasoning Drawer (Glass Box) con timeline agent steps.
- Policy Manager modal + Policies dedicated page master/detail.
- Audit Log viewer + chain integrity verify.
- Settings (Account, Engine, Security, Storage).
- Login + AuthGuard + Sidebar nav.
- Tenant header `X-Tenant-Id` + Bearer JWT propagati.
- ScoreGauge, SeverityBadge, PhaseIndicator components.
- Phase streaming progress bar.
- Electron shell con preload sandboxed.
- i18n (IT default, EN).

### Added — Infra

- Docker Compose single-tenant (engine + vLLM).
- Docker Compose multi-tenant (engine + Postgres + Qdrant).
- Helm chart skeleton (StatefulSet + ConfigMap + NetworkPolicy).
- Alembic migrations: 0001 schema, 0002 tenant_id, 0003 Postgres RLS.
- CI: lint + type-check + tests + egress lockdown gate (tcpdump + iptables).
- Mock LLM server per dev offline.

### Added — Docs

- Blueprint enterprise (`blueprint/00..09`).
- 11 ADR (`docs/adr/0001..0011`).
- Module docs: `agents`, `audit`, `events`, `tenant`, `api`.
- API reference `docs/api/endpoints.md`.
- Runbooks `setup-dev.md`, `kpi-evaluation.md`.
- Helm README.

### Security

- Egress lockdown CI gate (tcpdump zero-egress validation).
- CSP Electron strict, `nodeIntegration` off, sandbox on.
- Audit chain Ed25519 + immutable triggers.
- SQLCipher option attivabile via env.

